Inkling 2 loop forensics
Independent analysis of Thinking Machines Lab's Inkling 2 Mini.

This repository contains analysis, metadata and small scripts only. It redistributes no
model weights, checkpoints, GGUFs or safetensors.

Inkling 2 Mini is released by Thinking Machines Lab under the Apache License 2.0.
"Thinking Machines", "Inkling" and "Inkling 2" are trademarks of their respective owners.
This study is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Thinking Machines Lab.

Vendor metadata files in vendor/ (config.json, generation_config.json, hf_quant_config.json,
model.safetensors.index.json, the 2 MB safetensors header prefix, the chat template and the
Hugging Face API response) are retained for interoperability and analysis. They are not
weights and contain no tensor payloads.

